  "blurb": "A 400 m² oceanfront villa on the sand in Bophut, a short walk from Fisherman's Village, built around three private pools — an oceanfront infinity pool, a second pool by the outdoor entertaining area, and an onsen-style plunge pool beside the sauna and steam room. Six en-suite bedrooms, a games room, private bar and gym, run by six dedicated staff with breakfast and lunch cooked in.",
  "detail": "Set directly on the sand in Bophut, on Koh Samui's north coast, this six-bedroom villa sits about a ten-minute walk from the restaurants, bars and Friday Walking Street of Fisherman's Village, while keeping the beachfront itself peaceful and private. The house spans 400 m² and takes up to 12 guests across six en-suite bedrooms.\n\nThe upstairs living level is built for groups, with a 98-inch TV, a spacious dining area and a dedicated games room fitted with arcade machines and a ping-pong table. A large private bar with an outdoor projector opens onto the entertaining deck for slow afternoons and evenings under the stars.\n\nThree separate pools give the villa the range of a small resort: the main pool runs along the oceanfront with sweeping sea views, a second pool sits beside the outdoor entertaining area, and an onsen-style plunge pool anchors a private wellness corner alongside a fully equipped gym, sauna, steam room and jacuzzi — all reserved for villa guests.\n\nA team of six runs the property day to day: a villa manager, private chef, sous chef, two housekeepers and a handyman. The nightly rate includes unlimited electricity and water, daily housekeeping with bed linen changed twice weekly, a full breakfast, chef-prepared lunch (ingredients charged at cost plus a 20% handling fee), concierge support for tours and reservations, round-trip airport transfers, high-speed Wi-Fi, a digital safe and 24-hour security; a baby cot and high chair are available on request. Dinner can be arranged for THB 1,500 per sitting plus ingredients, and extra guests are charged at USD 59 per bed per night.\n\nA fully refundable cash security deposit of USD 1,000 (or THB 30,000 equivalent) is collected on arrival; any damage is charged at replacement value and settled before departure.",
